Microsoft Presidio
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The PII recognizer patterns in seeds/pii/recognizers.json are adapted from
Microsoft Presidio's predefined recognizers
(https://github.com/microsoft/presidio), licensed under the MIT License.

The patterns have been rewritten to be compatible with the Rust `regex` crate
(which does not support lookaround or backreferences) and re-scored for this
gateway's threshold model.

