Remote MCP server catalog
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MCP server catalog in seeds/mcp_servers/catalog.json is derived from the
curated table of vendor-hosted servers in awesome-remote-mcp-servers
(https://github.com/jaw9c/awesome-remote-mcp-servers), licensed under the MIT
License.

Entries are classified by authentication mode and checked for liveness before
they are included; for servers that answer without credentials, the tool list
each server advertised when it was checked is included as well.

